      "summary": "FRESH foot balm provides dry and rough skin with deep-acting moisture and leaves it noticeably supple. Valuable oat lipids and urea deliver maximum hydration. A plant butter complex nourishes intensively and strengthens the skin’s natural barrier. PHA ensures a particularly gentle exfoliating effect – without irritation.\n\nSelf-care for the night: Treat your feet to a relaxing massage before going to bed. Then put on socks and head to sleep. The highly concentrated active ingredients can absorb optimally overnight. In the morning, you’ll wake up to soft, smooth and perfectly cared-for skin.",
