      "application": "Apply FRESH foot balm as needed from the toes to the ankle and allow it to absorb well.\n\nExtra tip: Complete your evening routine and let FRESH foot balm work overnight under cotton socks after a relaxing foot massage. This enhances the nourishing effect and helps avoid slipping.",
