      "tagline": "Richly nourishing – deeply caring.",
      "summary": "The rich formula combines plant oils, nourishing butters and skin-identical lipids to strengthen the skin barrier and provide intensive care. Glycerine, urea, L-arginine, lactic acid and hyaluronic acid deeply hydrate the skin and help keep it soft over time. Ectoin and an extract from the resurrection plant soothe the skin and protect it from external stress factors.",
      "heroIngredients": "5% urea\nbinds moisture in the upper layers of the skin, visibly smooths dry, rough areas and reduces feelings of tightness. Urea also strengthens the skin barrier and reduces transepidermal water loss (TEWL)\n\n2.5% encapsulated ceramide complex\nstrengthens the skin’s natural barrier and helps retain moisture in the skin over the long term\n\n3% phytosqualane, 0.5% squalene & a biophyto sebum complex with 0.125% phytosterols\n* replenish lipids, intensely nourish and provide an especially skin-like care feeling. As a skin-identical lipid active ingredient, squalene strengthens the skin barrier, reduces moisture loss and protects against oxidative stress. *included in a scientifically studied concentration\n\n2% ectoin\nintensely hydrates and protects the skin from external stress factors. Strengthens the skin barrier and supports greater skin resilience\n\n2% shea butter & 0.3% cupuaçu butter\nprotect and intensely nourish the skin for a velvety-soft skin feel\n\n0.05% hyaluronic acid complex\nwith different molecular sizes for immediate smoothing on the surface, intensive hydration in deeper skin layers and long-lasting protection against moisture loss\n\n2.5% resurrection plant extract\nsoothes and intensely hydrates dry or irritated skin. Provides long-lasting protection against dryness and strengthens the skin barrier against environmental factors. The light citrus-like scent of the extract has a relaxing effect",
      "ingredientsNote": "INGREDIENTS:\nAqua (water), Glycerin** (plant-derived moisturising agent), Urea, Caprylic/Capric triglyceride (ester oil from natural fatty acids), Olive oil decyl esters* (silky conditioning active ingredients from olive oil), Squalane (olive squalane), Pentylene glycol (plant-derived moisturising agent), Cetearyl alcohol (fatty alcohol), Coco-Caprylate/Caprate (fatty acid ester), Oenothera biennis oil* (evening primrose oil), Butyrospermum parkii butter* (shea butter), Ectoin (powerful moisture regulator that helps protect skin), Hydrogenated olive oil stearyl esters** (skin-nourishing lipid), Glyceryl stearate (natural emulsifier), Macadamia integrifolia/tetraphylla seed oil* (nourishing oil from macadamia nut), Adansonia digitata seed oil* (baobab oil), Cetearyl glucoside (lamellar active ingredient), Dilinoleic acid/Butanediol copolymer (nourishing lipid complex), Microcrystalline cellulose (cellulose for a matte, velvety skin feel), C9-12 Alkane (natural emollient), Sodium lactate (part of the skin’s own natural moisturising factor), Xanthan gum (natural thickening agent), Squalene (olive squalene), Theobroma grandiflorum seed butter* (regenerating cupuacu butter), Myrothamnus flabellifolia leaf/stem extract (resurrection plant extract), Ceramide NP (lipid present in the skin), Lactic acid, Tocopherol (vitamin E), Ubiquinone (Coenzyme Q10), Ceramide AP (skin-barrier-strengthening ceramide), Hydrolysed hyaluronic acid (short-chain hyaluronic acid), Phytosterols (lipids that strengthen the skin barrier), Sodium phytate (antioxidant rice bran extract), Sodium stearoyl glutamate (natural emulsifier), Castor oil/IPDI copolymer (natural copolymer), Helianthus annuus seed oil (sunflower oil), Caprylyl glycol (skin hydrating substance), Glyceryl caprylate (natural emulsifier), Myristic acid (skin‑caring fatty acid), Oleic acid (skin‑caring fatty acid), Palmitic acid, Propanediol (natural moisturising agent), Arginine (moisturising amino acid), Alcohol (undenatured ethanol)\n\n* Ingredients from organic farming | ** Made using organic ingredients\n\nV 1.0\n\nA product’s ingredients may change over the course of time. If you want to know for sure what a product contains, the respective product packaging provides a list of ingredients.",
      "application": "Massage FRESH intensive hand cream from fingertips to wrists several times a day or in the evening as needed.\n\nFor an extra care boost, use FRESH intensive hand cream overnight. Apply generously to clean hands before bedtime and massage in gently. Then put on cotton gloves and allow the care to work intensively overnight. This supports optimal skin regeneration and allows the active ingredients to absorb effectively – for noticeably soft, regenerated hands in the morning.",
