      "tagline": "For those who never give up.",
      "summary": "No gain without pain. Endurance training such as running, swimming or cycling makes you sweat. Your body is working flat out. You lose fluid and your need for electrolytes increases. With SPORT endurance you’re taking in exactly what you need: energy, minerals and water – all in perfectly balanced proportions.\n\nThis carbohydrate-electrolyte solution contains a smart mixture of complex and simple carbohydrates. The combination provides you with instant, long-lasting and balanced energy. At the same time, it supports you with essential minerals such as potassium, calcium, magnesium and selenium, which are essential for the body if it’s under intense pressure. Fresh and fruity: lemon, passion fruit and apple harmonise, with a slightly salty an",
      "heroIngredients": "Complex carbohydrates\nsuch as maltodextrin and soluble corn wax starch provide the body with long-lasting energy\n\nSimple carbohydrates\nsuch as dextrose and fructose from lemon, passion fruit and agave ensure fast delivery of energy\n\nElectrolytes\nare important minerals that regulate fluid levels\n\nPotassium\ncontributes to normal muscle function\n\nMagnesium\ncontributes to electrolytic balance\n\nIron\ncontributes to the normal transport of oxygen in the body\n\nCalcium\ncontributes to normal muscle function and normal energy metabolisation\n\nSelenium\nhelps to protect the cells from oxidative stress\n\nVitamin C\nsupports the normal function of the immune system\n\nExtracts of grape fruit and apple peel\nare rich in antioxidants. They help to reduce oxidative stress – a key factor in reducing muscle fatigue and increasing stamina\n\nBetaine\nsupports the cells by maintaining water-binding. In this way it protects the cell structure and the proteins in the cells from osmotic stress and fluid loss",
      "ingredientsNote": "Food supplement in powder form for preparing a carbohydrate-electrolyte solution with plant substances,fruit powders, minerals, and vitamin C.\n\nINGREDIENTS\nHighly branched maltodextrin, waxy maize starch, dextrose, maltodextrin, agave syrup powder (Agave tequilana), lemon juice powder (Citrus limon), passion fruit juice powder (Passiflora edulis), sea salt, apple fruit powder (Malus domestica) (freeze-dried), potassium citrate, calcium lactate, calcium gluconate, magnesium citrate, calcium citrate, grape flesh and apple peel extract (sulphites) (Vitis vinifera, Malus pumila), betaine, acerola cherry powder (Malpighia glabra), lemon oil (Citrus limon), iron-enriched Aspergillus oryzae powder, selenium-enriched yeast.\n\nA product’s ingredients may change over the course of time. If you want to know for sure what a product contains, the respective product packaging provides a list of ingredients.\n\nRECOMMENDED CONSUMPTION\nTo prepare an isotonic carbohydrate-electrolyte solution, mix the contents of one sachet with 500 ml water.\n\nTo prepare a light hypotonic carbohydrate-electrolyte solution, mix the contents of one sachet with 600 — 700 ml water.\n\nDrink SPORT endurance before and during physical exercise or as required. Shake well before drinking.\n\nRecommended daily allowance:\n2 sachets (= 100 g)\n\nIMPORTANT INFORMATION\nThe stated recommended daily dose may not be exceeded. Food supplements should not be used as a substitute for a varied and balanced diet and a healthy lifestyle. The product is designed for adults and should be stored out of the reach of young children.\n\nSPORT endurance is not a medicinal product and is not intended to replace consultations with your doctor. SPORT endurance is not intended to treat or cure diseases. If you are taking prescribed medication, suffer from health problems, or are breastfeeding or pregnant, consult your doctor before using. Not suitable for pregnant or breast-feeding women. Sachets must not be passed on individually to third parties.\n\nSPORT endurance is regularly tested for anabolic steroids and stimulants by a world-leading laboratory in the analysis of doping substances in food supplements.\n\nThe product should be stored in a dry place and below 25 °C.\n\nBest before end / Batch number: see sealing sticker or sachet\n\nNUTRITIONAL INFORMATION\n\nNutritional information\n\nper 50 g\n1 sachet\n\nper 100 g\n2 sachet\n\n% NRV* per100 g\n2 sachets\n\nEnergy\n\n749 kJ\n179 kcal\n\n1,498 kJ\n358 kcal\n\n-\n-\n\nFat\n  of which saturates\n\n0 g\n0 g\n\n0 g\n0",
      "application": "To prepare an isotonic carbohydrate-electrolyte solution: mix the contents of one sachet with 500 ml water.\n\nTo prepare a slightly hypotonic carbohydrate-electrolyte solution: mix the contents of one sachet with 600–700 ml water. Drink SPORT endurance before, during or after physical activity, as required. Shake well before use.\n\nTIP: Energy that keeps you going\n\nSPORT endurance contains a perfect blend of carbohydrates from different sources. Your body is lastingly supplied with energy. The effect kicks in after 10 to 30 minutes. It can be measured on the basis of your blood sugar level. Drink SPORT endurance before or during exertion. For lasting power, drink 200 ml every 30 minutes. That way you’ll stay full of energy and optimally hydrated.\n\nDo not exceed the daily recommended allowance. Food supplements cannot replace a varied, balanced diet and a healthy lifestyle. The product is intended for adults and should be kept out of the reach of small children. Not suitable for pregnant or breastfeeding women.\n\nSPORT endurance is not a medicine and should not replace a visit to your doctor. SPORT endurance is not intended to treat or heal illnesses. If you are taking prescription med",
